# Minimal sshd_config fixture for the ssh_forward integration test.
# The linuxserver image default ships `AllowTcpForwarding no`, which would
# reject the direct-tcpip channel the tunnel needs. This file is copied to
# /config/sshd/sshd_config, and the image's init script then applies its
# env-driven settings (Port, PasswordAuthentication) on top of it.
Port 2222
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication yes
AllowTcpForwarding yes
GatewayPorts no
X11Forwarding no
PidFile /config/sshd.pid
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
